source_rows.effect:
#### Magma Initiation
When you learn Magma, choose the form your magma takes most often:
• red-gold lava;
• black slag;
• white-hot furnace stone;
• volcanic glass;
• subterranean pressure cracks;
• ash-veiled lava;
• spiritual molten ore;
• another appropriate expression.
This choice is cosmetic unless a feature says otherwise.
You learn to create small amounts of cultivated molten stone for Magma talents. These expressions are magical and fade when the talent ends unless a feature creates lasting obsidian, stone, or ruin.

